      "description": "The meme uses the term 'congress' to refer to a group of baboons, creating a pun that equates a human political institution with a group of monkeys. This metaphor is inherently degrading and mocking, as it reduces complex human governance to animal behavior, which can be interpreted as demeaning to democratic institutions.",
