      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_6e89db02",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "mocking_contempt",
      "label": "mocking contempt emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is one of mocking contempt, conveyed through the juxtaposition of the baboons' chaotic, shouting expressions with the text 'a group of baboons is called a congress' and 'it's all clear to me now.' The visual of the baboons roaring and the textual pun create a tone of ridicule toward political institutions, implying they are chaotic, animalistic, and unworthy of serious consideration. This emotion is derived from the meme's intent to trivialize human governance by equating it with animal behavior.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
