      "description": "The meme equates a political body (Congress) with a group of baboons, which is inherently degrading and mocking. This analogy trivializes serious political discourse and normalizes the use of animal imagery to mock human governance, potentially reinforcing harmful stereotypes and undermining the dignity of democratic institutions.",
